{
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The operations do not fall within the provisions of Schedule 2, Part 1, Class A of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) Order 2015, as amended. Specifically, there is a condition inserted on the original planning application for the site (reference: P0268.87) which restricts the use of the garage for the parking of private motor vehicles only. As such, planning permission is required for the garage conversion."
